{"id":"h01-41","volume":1,"volumeTitle":"人间词话","volumeSubtitle":"六十四则","index":41,"title":{"t":"寫情、寫景之不「隔」","s":"写情、写景之不「隔」"},"book":{"t":"人間詞話","s":"人间词话"},"sourceHead":{"t":"國粹學報本","s":"国粹学报本"},"author":"王国维","annotated":true,"paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"tr":"「人活不满一百年，却常常怀着千年的忧愁。白天太短，又苦于夜太长，为什么不举着蜡烛夜里游乐？」「吃药求仙，大多被药耽误。不如喝好酒，穿上细绢和素绸。」写情写到这个地步，才算不隔。","tokens":[{"t":"「","s":"「","punct":true},{"t":"生","s":"生","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"年","s":"年","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"不","s":"不","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"滿","s":"满","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"百","s":"百","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"常","s":"常","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"懷","s":"怀","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"千","s":"千","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"歳","s":"歳","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"憂","s":"忧","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true},{"t":"晝","s":"昼","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"短","s":"短","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"苦","s":"苦","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"夜","s":"夜","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"長","s":"长","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"何","s":"何","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"不","s":"不","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"秉","s":"秉","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"燭","s":"烛","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"遊","s":"游","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"？","s":"？","punct":true},{"t":"」","s":"」","punct":true},{"t":"「","s":"「","punct":true},{"t":"服","s":"服","py